    <!-- Help -->
    <string name="help_title">Help and MIUI setup</string>
    <string name="help_body">Bot commands\n• /start: links your chat (only the first chat that sends it)\n• /ping: replies \"pong\" if this phone is online and the app is running\n• /perf: shows the mode; /energy, /balanced, /performance switch it\n\nMIUI: Settings → Apps → SMS to Telegram\n• Autostart: on\n• Battery saver: No restrictions\n• Other permissions: allow everything SMS-related\n• Lock the app in recent apps (padlock)</string>

